    tags: ["Infrastructure", "Platforms", "AI systems"],
  },
  {
    number: "02",
    period: "Previously",
    role: "Making complex systems work.",
    company: "Previous chapter · Placeholder",
    description:
      "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Maecenas faucibus mollis interdum. Cras mattis consectetur purus sit amet fermentum. Etiam porta sem malesuada magna mollis euismod.",
